                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's fine, I guess. It's not bad or anything. It introduces a bunch of neat gimmicks, and then uses them like twice, and drops them when the next chapter starts. I feel like three chapters with the camera, or three chapters with the watch would've been much more satisfying. There's also a lot of backtracking for a game with so few rooms, and the buttons to turn around are really tiny for some reason.",
